.TH DIFTRAYWM-COMMANDS 7
.SH NAME
commands - selected DiftrayWM Command Bar commands
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
:spawn above|below
Create a terminal cell adjacent to the focused cell.
.TP
:cell select|focus|promote|restore
Operate on the selected terminal cell.
.TP
:tab next|prev
Cycle NCursor or GCursor tabs.
.TP
:workspace {1-10}
Switch workspaces.
.TP
:cursor list ids
List live graphical cursor identifiers.
.TP
:help {page}
Open a manual page.

.TP
:output list
List logical monitor geometry and the focused output.
.TP
:output focus {name|next|prev}
Focus a monitor. Meta+[ and Meta+] cycle monitors.
.TP
:output move {name}
Move the active NCursor and its graphical clients to a monitor.
.TP
:ncursor list|new
List NCursor and cell IDs, or create an NCursor on the focused monitor.
.TP
:cell move {cell-id} {ncursor-id}
Move a cell, including Notelet state and owned graphical clients.
.TP
:cursor move {cursor-id} cell|ncursor {destination-id}
Change a graphical cursor's ownership, preserving its docked state.
